{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing! Dialogue!\u00a0Upgrades!  The unbearable weight of a lifetime's worth of regrets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a bite-sized narrative fishing experience! Fish out a variety of ancient treasures, make small talk with your local low-level demon companion, and attempt to come to terms with the fact your will never get back all the time you wasted, or reconcile all the bad choices you made in life.<br><br>That is, of course, unless you can fish out Lucifer's crown and earn another chance at life. Many have tried for thousands of years, but you will be the one to finally do it, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789130/extras/aa1bf44bf57d9ebc42d3ad440d41631b.poster.avif?t=1750331235\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789130/extras/aa1bf44bf57d9ebc42d3ad440d41631b.webm?t=1750331235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789130/extras/aa1bf44bf57d9ebc42d3ad440d41631b.mp4?t=1750331235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun dialogue with your assigned demon</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789130/extras/42403d7bbfd5db6a53380e2297a718f8.poster.avif?t=1750331235\" width=444 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789130/extras/42403d7bbfd5db6a53380e2297a718f8.webm?t=1750331235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/